    "root: null = no root; scratch = a new dir under verification/.scratch; runs-scratch = a new dir under runs/.test-scratch-* (rootBase 'runs').",
    "timeoutMs keeps the current runner value (one value for every suite) so this file records today's behaviour; per-layer timeouts arrive in WP-1.",
    "baseline counts live in verification/parity-baseline.json, keyed by id. Do not edit both files by hand.",
    "resources: runs-root = needs a root under runs/, shares the copied budget ledger (serial phase);",
    "exclusive = binds ports 40290-40299 or asserts about the operating system, so it must not race (serial phase).",
    "Every other suite runs in the parallel phase, up to --jobs.",
    "per-suite timeouts: 600s everywhere except profiles (300s). profiles carries no mutation/matrix tests: WP-4 split",
    "them into profiles-retention and profiles-mutation, both marked \"deep\": true.",
    "deep suites are not part of npm test; run.mjs skips them unless --only names them, and npm run test:deep runs only",
